 2020 Teton County LiDAR Data and 3-ft resolution bare-earth Digital Elevation Model These datasets are very large and can be downloaded from the Idaho LiDAR consortium website using GLOBUS software. Go to  www.idaholidar.org  then locate data for download by clicking on Teton County on the Existing Data map for Idaho 



 2023 Aerial Imagery Complete tiled and mosaic imagery dataset for all of Teton County, acquired August 28 & 29, 2023 at 6"/pixel resolution. Tiled data is available in TIF and MrSID format. Mosaic is in MrSID format. Includes tile index and project report. The entire dataset is approximately 232 GB and requires a long download time. The mosaic is approximately 12.5 GB. 



 Address Points Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. Updated daily. 



 Building Footprints Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. Updated from aerial imagery acquired in August of 2023. 




 City Boundaries Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats.  
 Current city boundaries as of October 16, 2023. 





 Commissioner Districts Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. 
 Data is current. Commissioner Districts were last changed in 2019. 





 Parcels  Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. To download current parcels with attributes as a Google Earth file (KMZ),  click here . 
 Updated daily. 





 Parcel Tables Complete set of spreadsheet-compatible (.dbf) format tables from the Teton County Assessor detailing parcel characteristics, updated daily. 




 Parcel Table Summary (.dbf) format table from the Teton County Assessor summarizing basic parcel ownership information, updated daily. 



 Parcel Table Files List of Teton County Parcel Tables and associated  fields (.pdf format).  



 Parcel Table Field Descriptions Key to Teton County Parcel Table fields (.pdf format).  



 Property Categories Key to property category types used in the Parcel Tables (.pdf format). 



 Roads Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. Updated daily.  



 Subdivisions Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. Updated daily.  



 Voter Precincts Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. Last updated June, 2022; this is current data. 




 ZIP Codes 
 Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats. 
   
 Depicts local mail-delivery areas developed in cooperation with local USPS Postmasters. 




 Zoning Data can be downloaded in ESRI shapefile or file geodatabase formats, or as a Google Earth KML file. Includes currently adopted County Zoning, City of Driggs and Driggs Area-of-Impact  Zoning, Driggs special overlays and Airport zones, City of  Victor Zoning, City of Tetonia Zoning. Last updated October, 2023. 


 


 






